      "title": "Supreme Court agrees to take up MP’s plea against use of face-recognition tech on NEET-UG protesters",
      "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/supreme-court-agrees-to-take-up-mps-plea-against-use-of-face-recognition-tech-on-neet-ug-protesters/article71339912.ece",
      "description": "Rajya Sabha Member of Parliament A.A. Rahim said that the use of facial recognition technology and covert surveillance on peaceful protesters was unconstitutional",
      "source_name": "The Hindu National",
      "published": "2026-08-13T09:50:20"
